cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article in preferred-citation."
title: "RISU-PPUM: SMRF, SLRF and SDIF for hiding sensitive high-utility itemsets"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of the SMRF, SLRF and SDIF privacy preserving utility mining algorithms, which hide
  sensitive high-utility itemsets using the Real Item Sensitive Utility (RISU) of the sensitive items and the
  Weighted Sorting of the sensitive transactions, with a framework that runs and measures sanitization algorithms
  on the same inputs.
type: software
